    "body": "<!-- flclash:changelog:begin -->\n### Breaking Changes\n- **network** Desktop TUN keys follow the profile unless picked; changed values carry over\n\n### Features\n- **l10n** French, Spanish and Korean translations\n- **android** No more Firebase analytics or crash reporting\n- **network** Per-key desktop TUN settings; system proxy and tray fixes\n- **theme** Redesigned theme colors and color styles\n- **dashboard** A redesigned dashboard around the current exit\n- **profiles** Profile-detail resources and include-all in custom groups\n- **proxies** Proxy groups as cards, group tabs as chips\n- **views** Sortable tables for connections, requests and DNS\n- **ui** Optional two-tier Liquid Glass and slide-to-pick menus\n- **ui** iOS-style surfaces, alerts and sheets; clearer TV focus\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- **ui** Fix pasting and Chinese input in text fields\n- **core** Large profiles no longer crash; downloads trust core CAs\n\n### Performance\n- **android** Smoother Android UI while the proxy is busy\n\n<!-- flclash:changelog:end -->\n\n<!-- flclash:changelog:json\n{\"schemaVersion\":2,\"versions\":[{\"version\":\"0.9.1\",\"tag\":\"v0.9.1\",\"date\":\"2026-10-17\",\"prerelease\":false,\"groups\":[{\"type\":\"breaking\",\"entries\":[{\"id\":\"cb08088\",\"scope\":\"network\",\"text\":\"Desktop TUN keys follow the profile unless picked; changed values carry over\"}]},{\"type\":\"feat\",\"entries\":[{\"id\":\"f43755c\",\"scope\":\"l10n\",\"text\":\"French, Spanish and Korean translations\"},{\"id\":\"bc72bba\",\"scope\":\"android\",\"text\":\"No more Firebase analytics or crash reporting\"},{\"id\":\"cb08088\",\"scope\":\"network\",\"text\":\"Per-key desktop TUN settings; system proxy and tray fixes\"},{\"id\":\"5eafd7a\",\"scope\":\"theme\",\"text\":\"Redesigned theme colors and color styles\"},{\"id\":\"9bd258f\",\"scope\":\"dashboard\",\"text\":\"A redesigned dashboard around the current exit\"},{\"id\":\"0bac500\",\"scope\":\"profiles\",\"text\":\"Profile-detail resources and include-all in custom groups\"},{\"id\":\"2ea52fd\",\"scope\":\"proxies\",\"text\":\"Proxy groups as cards, group tabs as chips\"},{\"id\":\"da6fb0a\",\"scope\":\"views\",\"text\":\"Sortable tables for connections, requests and DNS\"},{\"id\":\"7c9627f\",\"scope\":\"ui\",\"text\":\"Optional two-tier Liquid Glass and slide-to-pick menus\"},{\"id\":\"9bd2286\",\"scope\":\"ui\",\"text\":\"iOS-style surfaces, alerts and sheets; clearer TV focus\"}]},{\"type\":\"fix\",\"entries\":[{\"id\":\"5607f70\",\"scope\":\"ui\",\"text\":\"Fix pasting and Chinese input in text fields\"},{\"id\":\"5984c16\",\"scope\":\"core\",\"text\":\"Large profiles no longer crash; downloads trust core CAs\"}]},{\"type\":\"perf\",\"entries\":[{\"id\":\"2201c19\",\"scope\":\"android\",\"text\":\"Smoother Android UI while the proxy is busy\"}]}]}]}\n-->\n<div align=center>\n\n[![Release Downloads](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/chen08209/FlClash/v0.9.1/total?style=flat-square&logo=github)](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/chen08209/FlClash/v0.9.1/)\n\n</div>\n\n**Download based on your OS:**\n\n<div align=left>\n<table>\n    <thead align=left>\n        <tr>\n            <th>OS</th>\n            <th>Download</th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody align=left>\n        <tr>\n        <td>Android</td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/chen08209/FlClash/releases/download/v0.9.1/FlClash-0.9.1-android-arm64-v8a.apk\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/APK-ARMv8-168039.svg?logo=android\"></a><br>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/chen08209/FlClash/releases/download/v0.9.1/FlClash-0.9.1-android-armeabi-v7a.apk\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/APK-ARMv7-45bf55.svg?logo=android\"></a><br>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/chen08209/FlClash/releases/download/v0.9.1/FlClash-0.9.1-android-x86_64.apk\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/APK-x64-96ed89.svg?logo=android\"></a>\n            </td>\n      